<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- MATENGO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Apilipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua jaka Pauli kwa Apilipi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Apilipi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Api</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua jaka Pauli ngati ejuandiki</para>
  <para style="mt1">Apilipi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Pauli jwaandakya balua likundi la bandu babuhobale Kilisitu buku Pilipi mu yaka ya sitini na moja baada ja kusaliwa kwaka Kilisitu. Jwaandika balua jenze kipindi jubi ku kipungu ku Loma. Mulipungu 1:13. Tuwesa kulibola majambu kidogu ga musi uku Pilipi mukitabu sa mahenu gaatumi. Musi wa Pilipi wabia musi nkolongu u nkoa uku Makedonia. Kabee labii likundi lutumbuli la bandu babuhobale Kilisitu kutumbuli mu nkoa uku Makedonia batumbuliya mu musi gongo. Pauli na Sila ndi babatumbuliya likundi heli na hata baajegala mu kipungu kwii ikilu jimu pababiya hoku. Mu mahengu 16.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kuwesikana Pauli jwabi na nia yingi pajwaandika balua jenze. Jatumia balua heji ngati napwasi ja kwaasengu bandu ba, ndaba ja hupi jebuntumila baada jukujowana jubii mukipungu. Mulipungu 4:10-19. Kabee jawesa kwaamanyisa hali jaki pajubii mukipungu na jatumia balua je heji kwamanyisa Timoteo na Epafulodito kulikundi la bandu babuhobale Kilisitu, ili awesa kwaajopa nukutenda isima ngati akakingosi wabu. Mulipungu 2:19-30.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabii nkati</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli jutumbuli balua jaki sukwalamuki bandu babuhobale Kilisitu babii kumusi uku Pilipi, linga lipungu 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io">Ndienu japwaji majambu gaki hejubii na majabu gajupala, mulipungu 1:3-2:30</para>
  <para style="io">Monikatai jaapeke malagiso gukuhenga paatama ngati bandu babuhobale Kilisitu. Mulipungu 3:1-4:9</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli jujomule sakwasengu bandu babuhobale Kilisitu buku Pilipi ndaba ja hupi yabu nakaalamuki. Mulipungu 4:10-23.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Nepani Pauli na Timoti, twaatumisi baka Yesu Kilisitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">Tunhandakii mwanganya mwabandu baka Sapanga ku Pilipi babube bajonganisi ni Kilisitu Yesu, pamu naka kilongosi na babaajangati bandu ba bunhobale Kilisitu.<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Bambu Sapanga jumpekia waamboni waki nu lukwali kabee nzopa haga kuhuma kwaka Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli jwaalobe Apilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Nunsengu Sapanga wangu kila panunkomboka, <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />na kila pa nunndobee mwaboa, nundoba sukutogule, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />ndaba nndei kunyangati mu mahengu gukulandi Lijambu la Amboni, tumbuka lisoba lu utumbulii mbaka lelenu. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Ndienu, mi nu usakaka Sapanga jojatumbuliya lihengu linyai nkati jinu, jajiendelesa mbaka palitimia Lisoba lukuhika kwaki Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Hela ndi embalika kunhwasali, ndaba nunkomboka masoba goti mmwoju jangu. Ndaba mwanganya mwaboti nnyangati mu waamboni gojumbeki Sapanga gukukengale nukulangi pangwendu Lijambu la Amboni, sajenu pa mi mukipungu na hata panabi nga nukumeka mukipungu. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Sapanga jumanya mbwaga sakaka, hembwaga ndokule ngamaa kummbona mu upali waka Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Kuloba kwangu ndi kongo, upali wii uendaliya kujonzukeka ngani pamu nu umanyi wa sakaka na malangu goti, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />ili nhwesa kuhagu lijambu lelibi la moju wa sapi, ndi pamwibia nga nilikosa lokapi mu lisoba lukuhika Kilisitu. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Womi winu witweelila majambu goa gagabii gasakaka na gaamboni. Gagugeni Yesu Kilisitu mweni juwesa kumpeke, ndaba ju ulumbi nu ulumbalii waka Sapanga.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutama ndi kuba na Kilisitu mmoju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Mwaalongu bangu, mbala mmnya majambu gala gagambataa gajangati ngamaa kuenesa Lijambu la Amboni. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Kulengana na haga, alonda boti ba nyumba jaka bambu nkolongu pamu na bangi boti pamba amanyiki mii mukipungu ndaba nepani nuntumaki Kilisitu. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Ndaba ji ipungu yangu kwaahengiki aka kilongu bingi kunhobale Bambu hata ahendale kuba na makili gukulandi lijambu laka Sapanga bila kujogopa.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Sakaka bandu bangi andandi Kilisitu ndaba abii na wipu na bandu bee haba apala kukomana, lakini bangi andandi Kilisitu kwa mawasu ga sapi. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Haba babundandi Kilisitu kwa moju wa asapi ahenga su upali, ndaba amanyiki Sapanga jumbeki lihengu lende kulikengale Lijambu la Amboni. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Baabi na wipu haba buntangasa Kilisitu sukutokule kwaabu beni nga kwa mwoju wa asapi, koni aholale binyonzukiya mang'aliku gangu mu kipungu.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Lakini heli kwangu nepani ngasindu! Nepani ndogule ana bandu bundandi Kilisitu kwii indela jokapi, jikubii kwa mawasu giliya au ga asapi. Kabee niiendaliya kutogule. <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Ndaba manyiki kukuloba kwinu nukuujangati wa Loho jaka Yesu Kilisitu niitenda kulekakewa. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Kutokule kwangu kukolongu nu kuhobale kwangu kubii ana, kwiindala jokapi nganiisindwi kulihenga lihengu langu, ila niibiya na mwoju wa nganganganga ngani kwa masoba goti na hasa kipindi senze, ili Kilisitu julumbilika mu nhyega jango jotii, panguba na mwomi au anawii. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Ndaba kwangu nepani kutama ndi kuba na Kilisitu mmoju jango, na kuwa ndi kupata gingi. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Lakini ngati kupete kutama niwesa kuhenga lihengu lelibii lukupata gingi, ndienu ngasemanyiki nhagu lako! <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Ganhuta majambu mabeli, ndokule kuboka muwomi gongo pamu ni Kilisitu, lijambu le heli la amboni ngamaa. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Lakini kwibia lijambu laamboni ngani kwinu ana hendalii kutama mu nndema gongo. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Ndaba mi nu usakaka wilijambu le heli, na hela manyiki niendaliya kutama pamu na mwanganya mwaboa, ili nhwesa kujonzuke kukola kwinu nu kutogule mu kuhobale kwinu. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Ndienu paniibiya na mwanganya kabee mmbiya na sindu sukukipunila ndaba jangu nepani pankubanzongini na Kilisitu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Lakini lijambu lelipalika mu mahengu ginu, nhenga ngati elipala Lijambu la Amboni laka Yesu Kilisitu, ili ana nhwesiki kuhika kwinu au nanzindiki, nyoana nzema nganganganga koni mmbii ni liwasu limu na mwoju gumu kukomane Lijambu la Amboni kwa pamu. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Wala mwaajogopa abaja babumpenga. Na heli laalangia bombi kuba biitenda kusindwa na mwanganya mwiitenda kuwesa ndaba Sapanga ndi jojupi uwesu. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Ndaba mpatiki wamboni waka Sapanga gu kuntumaki Kilisitu, na nga kunhobale pena, ila kabee nukung'aliswa kwa ndaba jaki, <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />henu nhwesa kujongana na nepani kukomana. Kukomana kwe hoku ndi komwamona nakakomana puuwanzu nahenu nakona nakakomana hadi sajeno ngati enzowana.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Kulihelea nu ukolongu waka Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Boo, kutama kwinu panzongini na Kilisitu kumpeki makile? Boo, upali waki gumpogale mwoju? Boo, nnzongini na Loho jaka Sapanga? Boo, mmbonane ikia pamu nukubonane usungu mwabeti kwa mwabete? <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />Ndienu munitwelakiya kutogule kwangu kwakuba niliwasu limu, nu upali gumu na mwoju gumu nukupala lijambu limu. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Mwihenga sokapi kwa mwoju uku tokule kwinu au sukukipuna bwaka, mmbiya nngungamali mwabeni na mwabeni, na kila jumu ammbona nnzaki kuba jojupalika kupeta jombi. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Kila jumu winu jwilingali majambu gaki mweni pena, ila juhenga kwa ndaba ja bangi. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Mmbia na mwoju agolagola gojwabinaku Kilisitu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Jombi toka mwandi jwabii Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:6">lakini ngasejukubweni kuba Sapanga kola ndi sindu sukukamulaki kwa makili.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Henu sukupala mweni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">jwagaleka goti haga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">nukulihenga ngati ntumisi, nukusaliwa ngati bandu bangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">nukubonikana ngati bandu.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Najombi pajabiya jubonikana na nhyega ngati mundu, jiligungamaliya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:8">nukujetake mbaka kuwa: Helo, kuwa punsalaba!<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Henu Sapanga ankwea kunani ngani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:9">nukumpeke liina likolongu kupeta mahina goti,<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />ili libiya ni isima liina laka Yesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:10">iumbi yoti yeibi kunani kwaka Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:10">nu yu pundema na ndema jeatama bandu bawii, ipega magoti palongi jaki,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />na kila mundu jwiijetakiya hotuhotu Yesu Kilisitu ndi Bambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:11">ku ulumbi waka Sapanga Atati.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kung'ala ngati ndondu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Henu mwa akosi bangu, panabii na mwanganya nnyoana ngamaa, hata sajenu pa mii kutali na mwanganya nhendaliya kunyogwane. Nhenga lihengu sukujogopa nukubagaja ku ukombosi winu, <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />ndaba Sapanga ndi jojuhenga lihenga muda woka nkati jinu, nukumpeke uwesu nu kupala kuhenga lelijongana numpangu waki mweni.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Nhenga majambu goti bila kulelaneka wala kubisana, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />ili mpata kuba mwabandu ba sapi, banga nilikosa, ngati bana ba sapi baka Sapanga baatama mu ndema guliya na goguhobiki. Mwing'ala kwabu ngati ndondu ejimulika kunani, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />namulikamwi nganganganga lilobi la womi, na hapa nane panibiya na ndaba jukipunii lisoba lela laka Kilisitu, ndaba kwiibonikana hotuhotu kukasana kwangu nilihengu langu ngaselahoba bwaka.<verse eid="PHP 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Lakini hata ngati biimbiya ili nguba litambiku sindu sa kunywa pamu nukuhobale kwinu kokubi litambiku kwaka Sapanga, nala ndogule ngamaa nukujongana na mwanganya mwaboti kutogule hoku. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Ahelahela, mwanganya nanamu kupalika kutogule nukululuta pamu na nepani.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoti na Epafulodito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Kupete kujongana na Bambu Yesu nhobale niiwesa kuntuma Timoti kwinu eheno, ili mbata kupogaleswa mwoju wangu panipata majambu ginu. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Ngasemii na mundu jongi ngati jombi, jojulingali majambu ginu kwa mwojo. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Ndaba kila jumu juhenga ngani majambu gaki mweni, wala ngase juhenga majambu gaka Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Lakini mwanganya mwabeti mmanyiki Timoti ejililangi mweni juwesa, ndaba jombi na nepani tubii ngati mwana na atati baki, tuhengiki lihengu li Lijambu la Amboni pamu. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Henu nhobale kuntuma kwinu nyata paniimanya majambu gangu pagiimbitila. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Nanamweti nhobale kwaka Bambu ana nihika kwinu pambipi pani.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Lakini nemona sapi nuntuma kwinu nndongu witu Epafuladitu, jojuwe nnzangu mu lihengu na nkomana ngondu nnzangu na jojuwe mwanganya muntuma kwangu juhika kunyangati. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Jupala ngamaa kumbona mwanganya, na ngasejubii na laha, ndaba mwanganya mwajowini jabii nngonzu. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Sakaka jabii nngonzu, kabee pambipi na kuwa. Lakini Sapanga ambonila ikia, wala nga jombi pena, ila hata nepani jamonila ikia, ili niikuba nusungu nkolongu. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Ndienu mbala ngamaa kuntuma kwinu, ili pamwammbona nhwesa kutogule kabee, na huzuni jangu nepani jiboka. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Henu munzopa sukutogule kukolongu, jombi nndongu witu mu Bambu. Mpalika kwaatende isima bandu baabi ngati jombi, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />ndaba jaegaliya hata kuwa ndaba jilihengu laka Kilisitu, nukuhatalisa womi waki ili juwesa kunyangati nepani goguwe mwanganya ngasemwawesiki kunyangati.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Mwihobale majambu ya nhyega</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Sukujomule, mwalongu bangu ntoguliya koni nnzongini na Bambu. Ngasenzoka kukelabuki ganunhandaki puwanzu, ndaba ganhenga mmbia nulukwali. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Nzepana na bandu batenda mahakau, yaka nakabwa heyi, bandu bahahingamaki kuseku jandu. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Ndaba twepani ndi twabandu totusekwi jandu sakaka, nga bombe! Ndaba twepani tuhobale Sapanga kwi indela ja Loho waki, nutukipuni sukujongana na Kilisitu Yesu. Nangasetuhobale hindu yeibii kunza ju nhyega. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Nepani ahelahe nakabia nhwesiki kugajetake majambu gagahengeka mu nhyega. Ana jubii mundu jojuwasali jugahobale majambu haga, hoju ngajwakawesiki kunzinda nepani. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Nepani banzekula jandu lisoba la nani toka panasaliwa. Nepani ndi namundu juku Izilaeli, likabila laka Benyamini, kabee nu Nhebulania jwa sakaka. Kwa majambu gukukamulaki Malagalaki nepani nabii Mfalisayo. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Nakasini ngamaa nabiya hata naang'alisa bandu ba bunhobali Kilisitu. Kulijambu lukujetakewa na Sapanga sukukamulaki Malagalaki nepani ngasenabii nilikosa. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Lakini majambu ge gala goti gagabii nagawasalia gasapi na gukunyangati, henu nagabalanga kuba asala ndaba jaka Kilisitu. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Kulekana na haga, nagabalanga majambu goti kuba asala ndaba jilijambu likolongu ngani yaani kummanya Yesu Kilisitu Bambu wangu. Ndaba jaki jombi nyetaki kuleke kutali kila sindu, moniki haga goti gabii ngati imai ili numpata Kilisitu, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />nukujonganiswa najombi ngani. Nepani ngasembai kabee lijambu lukujetakewa na Sapanga kwii ndela jukupwata Malagalaki. Ila mbala kujetakewa na Sapanga kwii indela jukunhobale Kilisitu, kujetake hoku kuhuma kwaka Sapanga kwii indela jukuhobale. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Sembala pee ndi kummanya Kilisitu na makili gukuyoka kwaki, nuku kuba pamu mu mang'aliku gaki, nakuba ngati jombi mu kuwa kwaki, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />koni nhobale na nepani niitenda kuyoka.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyombateka ili nhika kombala kuhika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Ngasembwaga ndei kuhika au ndei kukamilika. Henu nhendale kukasana ili mbata seketuli jela jejuje Yesu Kilisitu jumbatiki nepani. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Mwaalongu bangu, ngasembwaga ndei kupata. Lakini nhenga sindu simu, nyewa majambu gagapetiki, na ngasanii kwagalingali gagabii palongi. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Ndienu, mutuki kujenda kombala ili mbata nhupi jeheji, jejuje ukemi waka Sapanga kwa womi ukunani kwaka Sapanga kwi indela jaka Kilisitu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Henu twepani totukomi mu loho tuwasaliya lijambu lelele, hata na bangi awasali majambu gangi, Sapanga jalibeka pagwendu leniheli. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Lakini patuhiki pani na tuendaliya kugahenga gagaga.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Mwaalongu bangu, mpwata lilenganu langu. Tumpeki lilenganu mwaajoannya baapwata lilenganu lende. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Numpwagi lijambu le heli mala jingi na henu ngelabuki kabee kwa maholi. Bandu bingi atama ngati abaya bu nsalaba waka Kilisitu. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Mwisu wa bandu be haba kuhoba, ndaba litumbu labu ndi isapanga yabu, akipuni majambu gaguge kupalika bagabonila giiyoni, na aholale pe majambu gu pundema. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Lakini wenei witu gubii kunani kwaka Sapanga. Natwe tunndendale sukuhobale nkombosi witu kuhuma hoku yani, Bambu Yesu Kilisitu, <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />jombi jwaing'anambula nhyega jejihalabika, ili jiwesa kulengana na nhyega jaki junu ulumbi, ku uwesu golagola goguwe juwesa hata kwi ikema indu yoti ibia pai ju ulongosi waki.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s">Malagisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Henu mwaalongu bangu monumpai, ne ndokule ngamaa kumbona, mwanganya mombii kutogule kwangu ni liseketule lu kuwesa kwangu, henu ndi empalika kutama nganganganga sukujongana na Bambu, mwaalongu bangu monumpai.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Euodia na suntike, nunndobe nukundoba nnzongana mwakikilongu kwaka Bambu. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Nawehapa gunndongu wangu woguhobaleka, nugupala wajangatya aka nyongo haba, ndaba ahengiki lihengu lukulandi Lijambu la Sapa nakanopi pamu na Kelementi baahenga lihengu ajangu na bangi boti babube mahina gabu gaahandikwi mu kitabu sa womi.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Ndienu ntoguliya mu Ubambu masoba goti, kabee mbwaga ntoguliya!<verse eid="PHP 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Upoli winu gumanyikana na bandu boti. Bambu jubii pambipi. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Mwalihole lijambu lokapi, ila kila sempala, mundoba Sapanga numbiya na mwoju ukunsengu. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Nulukwali lwaka Sapanga, jejipeta malangu goka ga bandu, janndenda mioju jinu na malangu ginu sukujongana na Kilisitu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Mwisuwe mwaalongu bangu, nhwasaliya majambu goti gagabii na gokapi gagabii gaamboni gukulumbalika: Na gokapi gagabii na gajupla Sapanga na gokapi gagabii gaa sapi na gokapi gagapalika kulumbalika na goti gagabii gihisima ana gubii usapi wokapi, anakibii sokapi sekipalika kulumbalika, nhwasaliya majambu ganga. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Majambu goka gamwiliboliki au kugajopa au kugajoana kuhuma kwangu, au kugabona, mugahenga haga. Najombi Sapanga ju lukwali jwibiya pamu na mwanganya.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli jaansengu Apilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Natogulii ngamaa enyongini na Bambu ndaba mwisuwe mwapata kabee mbekenyu jukulangi ndenda kunkomboka. Kupwaga sakaka ngomboka kila lisoba ila pe ngasemwapatiki mbekenyu jukulangii lijambu le heli. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Ngasebwaga hela ndaba jukupala sindu! Ndaba niliboliki kulisika na hindu yeminaku. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Manyiki kusindwa kuba na hindu na jakuba na mali gingi. Nhyobali kulisika kwa kila hali na kwa kila hindu, miya nusukutosa au mii ni inzala: Panguba na mali gingi au panguba nganasindu. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Nhwesa kuhinakali kila hali ndaba Kilisitu jumbeke makili.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Lakini, mwahengiki gaamboni kuba pamu na nepani mumang'aliku gango. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Mwanganya mwa Pilipi mmnyiki lisoba lukutumbuka kulandi Lijambu la Amboni kwangu, panabiya ndenda kuboka ku Makedonia, mwanganya kajika jinu ndi mwabandu babunzetaki Kilisitu bamwanyangatii, mwanganya kajika jinu ndi momwajongana nanepani mukujopa nakaapeke bangi hindu. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Panabiya mbala kunyangatii ku Tesaloniki mwandenda kunete, kupeta mala jimu. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Si mbala kujopa nhupi pena ila sembala hindu hijonzukika mu upandi wino. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Ndienu, nyopiki hindu yoti yemwambeki, kabee mwambeki mali gingi ngani kuliku yenabiya niipala. Mina kila sindu ndaba Epafuladitu juneti nhupi hinu. Nhupi ye heyi ndi ngati litambiku lelibii luhumba lwa asapi, litambiku lelijetakeka nukundengane Sapanga. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Ndienu Sapanga wangu, kwa hindu yaki hingi ku ulumbi waki kwi indela jaka Yesu Kilisitu, jampekia hindu yempala yoti. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Ulumbi gubiya kwaka Sapanga jojubii Atati bitu, yaka petapeta. Amina.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malamuki gukujomule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Walamukiya bandu boti bajongini ni Kilisitu Yesu. Aka kilongu baabi pamu nanepani pamba atenda kunndamuki. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Bandu boa baka Sapanga pamba, na hasa baabi mu nyumba jaka bambu nkolongu juku Loma, buntenda kundamu.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Nundobe mwaboti wamboni waka Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu gubiya pamu na mwanganya.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>